A Baby Friendly, central, luxurious and spacious one bedroom apartment in Chiado. Live at the rhythm of the romantic beat of Lisbon downtown. Great to discover the city center.

The space
APARTMENT
- charming, luxurious and spacious apartment. 
- one double bedroom with closet, one spacious marble bathroom with a bathtub, lounge and open kitchen.

EQUIPMENT
- one bedroom with queen bed and closet. 
- sofa bed in the lounge that accommodates two extra guests. 
- desk in the living room.
- fully equipped with brand new appliances (stove, oven, fridge, freezer, microwave, washing machine, dishwasher, kettle, blender, juice squeezer, toaster, coffee machine - Nespresso, vacuum cleaner, iron and ironing board, hairdryer);
- Safe;
- Air conditioning and central heating in all the rooms
- SMART TV with free access to many international and kids channels; 
- high-speed wi-fi;
- fire extinguisher, fire blanket, first aid kit.

AMENITIES
- best quality bed linens;
- full set of towels (hands, face, body);
- for stays longer than four days, we can offer robes and slippers (upon request);
- duvet hypoallergenic for winter and for summer;
- extra blanket;
- beach towels (upon request);
- shampoo, shower gel, liquid hand soap;
- toilet paper, kitchen role and napkins;
- washing powder, tablets and washing up liquid;
- bath caps and hydrating cream;
- olive oil, vinegar, salt.

All our textiles are washed and sterilized by a laundry company that follows the health and safety rules of hospitality.

BUILDING
- Historic building from 1850 part of the old convent of Sacramento, fully restored (completed in 2014).
- Building with security system (CCTV).
- There is a public car park just beside the building called Chiado Park (price not included in the apartment).

Guest access
A BABY-FRIENDLY APARTMENT:
We like to welcome babies and children with love and affection.
That's why we have all the necessary equipment so that the little ones feel very comfortable.
Upon request, we can provide a travel baby bed with an extra mattress, bed linens and bath towels, high chair for meals, stroller, bathtub, A playing mat, small table and chairs, toys, books and games depending on age.
FOR BABIES UP TO TWO YEARS WE OFFER THE STAY ☺

Other things to note
- When making your reservation for more than two guests, please note that there is a small extra payment. This will be visible in the breakdown of the total price of the reservation.
- In case of the apartment is not available on the dates that you want, the Courtesy Morning has other apartments in the Airbnb also in the historic area of the city. Talk with us.

